  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the curry powder, salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the papelon and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the curry for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
